{"id":"b99217d91b7f4f4f","group":"27","path":"27/27-lem-purequadterms.md","title":"Every term of a quadratic DNF of a purely quadratic function is prime","display":"lem-purequadterms — Every term of a quadratic DNF of a purely quadratic function is prime","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-lem-purequadterms","aliases":["27-lem-purequadterms"],"display":"lem-purequadterms — Every term of a quadratic DNF of a purely quadratic function is prime","depends_on":["[[27-df-purelyquadratic]]","[[27-df-piset]]","[[27-df-litset]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§5.1 Lemma 5.1","source_statement":"Every term of a quadratic DNF of a purely quadratic function is prime","source_printed_pages":"204","source_pdf_pages":"228","verification_status":"proved-in-note-source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-lem-purequadterms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-lem-purequadterms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-purequadterms — Every term of a quadratic DNF of a purely quadratic function is prime"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"07dcb8bee101c949\" href=\"?note=07dcb8bee101c949\" title=\"27-df-purelyquadratic\">27-df-purelyquadratic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§5.1 Lemma 5.1"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b99217d91b7f4f4f\" href=\"?note=b99217d91b7f4f4f\" title=\"Every term of a quadratic DNF of a purely quadratic function is prime\">Every term of a quadratic DNF of a purely quadratic function is prime</a>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"204"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"228"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note-source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PureQuad}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PureQuad}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n\">\\(D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)=f\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)=f\\)</span>；各符号见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"07dcb8bee101c949\" href=\"?note=07dcb8bee101c949\" title=\"27-df-purelyquadratic\">27-df-purelyquadratic</a> 及其上游。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a> 的素项集函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lits}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lits}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a> 的项文字集函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\land\\forall T\\in D\\;(|\\mathrm{Lits}(T)|=2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D\\subseteq\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\land\\forall T\\in D\\;(|\\mathrm{Lits}(T)|=2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个 D 的项均蕴含 f。非素二次项必能删去文字得到一次或空蕴涵项；前者违反 purely quadratic，后者使 f 恒1。一次和空项也分别被同一条件排除。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-purelyquadratic","status":"resolved","id":"07dcb8bee101c949","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-purelyquadratic]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-piset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-litset","status":"resolved","id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-litset]]","embed":false},{"target":"Every term of a quadratic DNF of a purely quadratic function is prime","status":"resolved","id":"b99217d91b7f4f4f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · source_statement","heading":"","excerpt":"[[Every term of a quadratic DNF of a purely quadratic function is prime]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-purelyquadratic","status":"resolved","id":"07dcb8bee101c949","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PureQuad}_n$，$D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n$，$\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)=f$；各符号见 [[27-df-purelyquadratic]] 及其上游。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PI}$ 为 [[27-df-piset]] 的素项集函数，$\\mathrm{Lits}$ 为 [[27-df-litset]] 的项文字集函数。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-litset","status":"resolved","id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PI}$ 为 [[27-df-piset]] 的素项集函数，$\\mathrm{Lits}$ 为 [[27-df-litset]] 的项文字集函数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PureQuad}_n","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)=f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PI}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lits}","display":false},{"tex":"D\\subseteq\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\land\\forall T\\in D\\;(|\\mathrm{Lits}(T)|=2).","display":true}],"bytes":1468,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-lem-purequadterms|lem-purequadterms — Every term of a quadratic DNF of a purely quadratic function is prime]]"}],"outgoing":["07dcb8bee101c949","3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","8311e93eaac6c631"]}